  # OWNER, 2026-10-31: the magazine is detachable, THE WHOLE MAGAZINE, base plate to receiver. Carved
  # out of the body surface with tools/carve/md3_carve_surface.py --slab-axis z --slab -18 0.1
  # --centre 38.4 0 --half 2.6 1.8: 1008 triangles. The first cut (slab top -3.6) took only the collar
  # and base plate, because the mag's side triangles reach up to z 0 inside the receiver and a triangle
  # moves only when all three vertices are selected. sheet.png shows the cut. Drops -Z.
